# Ubuntu 26.04 live ISO — system Flatpak applications
#
# These are installed into the live squashfs at build time and copied
# to the installed system by tuna-installer (CopyFlatpaks).
#
# Note: org.bootcinstaller.Installer is handled separately in
# install-flatpaks.sh (GitHub Releases bundle, not on Flathub).
#
# LibreOffice ships as debs in the official Ubuntu 26.04 ISO but we deliver
# it as a Flatpak so it lands cleanly on the installed composefs read-only
# system without needing to touch the deb package layer.
org.libreoffice.LibreOffice
